Changes:
- NEW: src/features/notifications/dailyBeerReminderService.ts
  * 31-message rotating copy pool (generic, no beer name/details)
  * Android channel: hhs-daily-beer (HIGH importance, gold light color)
  * scheduleDailyBeerReminder(): cancel-then-schedule at 4:00 PM local daily
  * cancelDailyBeerReminder(): cancel by stable identifier to avoid duplicates
  * syncDailyBeerReminder(enabled): called on setting toggle; caches pref locally;
    only schedules if permission already granted (no auto-prompt)
  * syncDailyBeerReminderOnStartup(): called at app boot; re-schedules only if
    not already queued (handles app update clearing scheduled notifications);
    never requests permission

- MODIFIED: src/features/settings/NativeAccountSettingsScreen.tsx
  * Import syncDailyBeerReminder
  * handlePreferenceChange: calls syncDailyBeerReminder(value) when daily_beer toggles

- MODIFIED: src/navigation/NativeAppShell.tsx
  * Import syncDailyBeerReminderOnStartup
  * NativeAppShellContent: useEffect on mount calls syncDailyBeerReminderOnStartup()

